  "title": "Ultra Sweet Greek Yogurt Horiatiki Salad",
  "description": "A sweet and refreshing Greek dish featuring Greek yogurt and a soffritto base, perfect for a brunch mood. This sugar-free friendly recipe is served in an agave leaf vessel.",
