  "instructions": [
    "In a large bowl, whisk together the Greek yogurt, honey, and lemon juice until smooth.",
    "In a separate bowl, combine the sliced cucumber, diced tomato, and thinly sliced red onion.",
    "Add the Kalamata olives to the bowl with the vegetables and toss to combine.",
    "Drizzle the extra-virgin olive oil over the vegetable mixture and toss to coat.",
    "Add the vegetable mixture to the bowl with the yogurt mixture and stir to combine.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Garnish with chopped fresh dill and serve in an agave leaf vessel.",
    "Refrigerate for at least 30 minutes to allow the flavors to meld.",
    "Serve chilled and enjoy."
  ],
